WEBVTT

00:00:00.454 --> 00:00:01.117
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.098 --> 00:00:04.812
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Yesterday, John got a jet to New York.

00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:07.405
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:10.180
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’ve just got a new job!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:12.864
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:15.955
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> A lot of young people like jazz.

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:18.563
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:19.407 --> 00:00:21.635
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you want your yellow jacket?

00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:24.009
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:26.673
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The journey took over a year.